WEBVTT

00:13:28.930 --> 00:13:30.958
if there were no homeless children,

00:13:30.982 --> 00:13:33.241
if there were no uneducated children.

00:13:33.265 --> 00:13:35.639
And so it's really about
what does it mean to live

00:13:35.663 --> 00:13:37.964
and lead this life.

00:13:37.988 --> 00:13:39.425
Why were we put on this earth?

00:13:39.449 --> 00:13:42.329
We were put on this earth
to make things better

00:13:42.353 --> 00:13:43.568
for the next generations.

00:13:43.592 --> 00:13:46.047
And here we're worrying
about climate change

00:13:46.071 --> 00:13:47.577
and global warming.

00:13:47.601 --> 00:13:50.517
And we're looking at, again,
I constantly cite --

00:13:50.541 --> 00:13:53.466
I look at that "Bulletin
of Atomic Scientists" every year.

00:13:53.490 --> 00:13:55.543
And it says now:
"Two minutes to midnight."

00:13:55.567 --> 00:13:57.141
Are we out of our minds, adults,

00:13:57.165 --> 00:14:01.217
about passing on a better a world
to our children?